    "sections": {
        "description": "Abnomize is a sleek and modern WordPress theme designed for Full Site Editing (FSE). It's optimized for speed and performance, ensuring your website loads quickly and efficiently. With its pre-built block patterns, you can easily create stunning layouts and customize your site's design without writing a single line of code. Abnomize is also mobile-friendly, SEO-optimized, and translation-ready, making it a versatile choice for businesses of all sizes."
